@startuml c4-system-context
!pragma layout smetana
!include theme.iuml
title C4 Level 1: EOAP learning platform system context
rectangle "Self-learner\n[Person]\nStudies and executes EOAP exercises" as Learner #D5E9EF
rectangle "Module developer\n[Person]\nAuthors courses and verifies acceptance" as Developer #D5E9EF
rectangle "EOAP learning and validation platform\n[Software system]\nProvides reproducible browser workspaces\nand module-specific execution checks" as Platform #B9DCDD
rectangle "Training repositories\n[External software system]\nCourse source, notebooks, typed CWL\nand reference tests" as Training #EEEEEE
rectangle "Artifact services\n[External software system]\nRegistries, release assets, Python packages\nand editor extensions" as Artifacts #EEEEEE
rectangle "EO data services\n[External software system]\nSTAC catalogs, imagery and\nauthenticated acquisition APIs" as Data #EEEEEE
rectangle "Kubernetes cluster\n[External execution platform]\nSupplies scheduling, storage and RBAC\nMinikube is the tested local host" as Kubernetes #EEEEEE
Learner --> Platform : follows courses; inspects outputs
Developer --> Platform : validates named source and artifacts
Platform --> Training : obtains course content
Platform --> Artifacts : obtains runtime dependencies and images
Platform --> Data : resolves scenes and retrieves assets
Platform --> Kubernetes : deploys workspaces and executes workloads
legend bottom
  Teal: platform under discussion / its users. Gray: external dependencies.
  Separate course repositories remain source dependencies, not this repository's files.
endlegend
@enduml
